  "limits": [
    "No statistically established improvement over the stronger domain-specific fixed comparator in v38.",
    "Existing vLLM scheduler and confidence head; cost-table ablation only. Online calibration did not produce the gains.",
    "One model pair and H200; FP32 tensor dtype does not establish globally strict IEEE arithmetic.",
    "V26 and v38 used disjoint prompts at their respective launches; MBPP expanded from sanitized to full official test subset in v38.",
    "The exploratory 10\u201315% chat effects did not reproduce at that magnitude against stronger baselines.",
